        "data": {
          "comment": "# Themes Across Customer Feedback\n\nGroups raw customer feedback into named themes with a rough count and one representative quote each. The quote lets a reader check the theme instead of taking it on trust.\n\n**How it works:** Paste comments into \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" clusters them by its system prompt and orders the themes by frequency, and \"3 Output\" returns the list.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Agent\", then paste a week of support tickets or survey answers into \"1 Input\"."
